      "case": "G05-01",
      "status": "PASS",
      "reason": "A signed public event traversed three actual PWA bridge contexts and four independent Geode relays in the R1→R2→R3→R4 chain; each hop and the final inbox were independently reconciled."
    },
    {
      "case": "G05-02",
